#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will be shared only if your consent to an additional "
"consent form as explained above."
msgstr ""
"Avdio-vizualno gradivo bomo delili le, če se boste strinjali z dodatnim "
"obrazcem za soglasje, kot je pojasnjeno zgoraj."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we may share your audio-visual material along with fully "
"anonymized data, such as demographic, aggregated, or extracted data."
msgstr ""
"V teh primerih lahko vaše avdiovizualno gradivo delimo skupaj s popolnoma "
"anonimiziranimi podatki, kot so demografski, agregirani ali ekstrahirani "
"podatki."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"We will never connect your real name or any of your personal information "
"directly to your image or sound recording, even though it is off course "
"possible to recognize individuals based on audio-visual material."
msgstr ""
"Vašega pravega imena ali katerega koli vašega osebnega podatka ne bomo "
"nikoli neposredno povezali z vašo sliko ali zvočnim posnetkom, čeprav je na "
"podlagi avdiovizualnega gradiva seveda mogoče prepoznati posameznike."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All the recordings we obtain during this research will be kept confidential,"
" and nobody outside the group of researchers will be able to share or store "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Vsi posnetki, ki jih bomo pridobili med to raziskavo, bodo zaupni in nihče "
"zunaj skupine raziskovalcev jih ne bo mogel deliti ali hraniti."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your recordings to derive your real "
"identity, personal information could be leaked if you are not in an isolated"
" environment."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav raziskovalci vaših posnetkov ne bodo uporabili za ugotavljanje vaše "
"resnične identitete, lahko pride do razkritja osebnih podatkov, če ne boste "
"v izoliranem okolju."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"By consenting to this experiment, you are committing not to use profanity "
"while recording audio or nudity while recording video."
msgstr ""
"S privolitvijo v ta poskus se zavezujete, da med snemanjem zvoka ne boste "
"uporabljali žaljivk, med snemanjem videoposnetkov pa se ne boste razgaljali."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to sit in a room that is isolated from the rest of"
" the house."
msgstr ""
"Morda boste na primer želeli sedeti v sobi, ki je izolirana od preostalega "
"dela hiše."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, in some experiments, your recordings may be seen or heard by other "
"participants in order to evaluate them in different attributes or create new"
" materials (for example replicate a rhythm that you created, or continue a "
"melody that you sang)."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih eksperimentih pa lahko vaše posnetke vidijo ali slišijo drugi "
"udeleženci, da bi jih lahko ovrednotili z različnimi atributi ali ustvarili "
"novo gradivo (na primer ponovili ritem, ki ste ga ustvarili, ali nadaljevali"
" melodijo, ki ste jo zapeli)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If you choose to participate in the experiment, it is important and your "
"responsibility to make sure that while you record audio and video nothing "
"that you don’t intend to be recorded is recorded."
msgstr ""
"Če se odločite sodelovati v eksperimentu, je pomembno in vaša odgovornost, "
"da med snemanjem zvoka in slike poskrbite, da se ne posname nič, česar ne "
"nameravate posneti."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Raw audio/video will not be shared with collaborators (we will only share "
"extracted data from recordings without personal identifiers)."
msgstr ""
"S sodelavci ne bomo delili neobdelanih avdio/video posnetkov (delili bomo le"
" izvlečke podatkov iz posnetkov brez osebnih identifikatorjev)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"You may wish to make sure that no sounds/visual material in your environment"
" could be linked to your personal information. In addition, while you "
"perform a recording, the microphone or camera can capture unintended audio "
"or video, for example the camera can capture another family member, or the "
"microphone can capture something you say to another person."
msgstr ""
"Morda boste želeli zagotoviti, da nobenega zvočnega/vizualnega materiala v "
"vašem okolju ni mogoče povezati z vašimi osebnimi podatki. Poleg tega lahko "
"med izvajanjem snemanja mikrofon ali kamera posname nenačrtovan zvok ali "
"video, na primer kamera lahko posname drugega družinskega člana ali pa "
"mikrofon posname nekaj, kar rečete drugi osebi."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be associated with your name or other identifiers "
"in any way."
msgstr ""
"Vaši posnetki ne bodo na noben način povezani z vašim imenom ali drugimi "
"identifikatorji."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be used to derive your real identity, and they will"
" not be made public."
msgstr ""
"Vaši posnetki ne bodo uporabljeni za ugotavljanje vaše resnične identitete "
"in ne bodo javno objavljeni."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid ""
"By consenting to participate, you acknowledge that you are 18 years or "
"older, have read this consent form, agree to its contents, and agree to take"
" part in this research."
msgstr ""
"S privolitvijo v sodelovanje potrjujete, da ste stari 18 let ali več, da ste"
" prebrali ta obrazec privolitve, se strinjate z njegovo vsebino in se "
"strinjate s sodelovanjem v tej raziskavi."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid "Consent"
msgstr "Privolitev"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid "If you do not wish to consent, please close this page."
