#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-contact"
msgid "Contact information"
msgstr "Kontaktni podatki"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this online form is to give you information to help you "
"decide whether you want to take part in a research study."
msgstr ""
"Namen tega spletnega obrazca je dati vam informacije, ki vam bodo pomagale "
"pri odločitvi, ali želite sodelovati v raziskovalni študiji."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"This research is being conducted by researchers at the Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"To raziskavo izvajajo raziskovalci na Inštitutu Maxa Plancka za empirično "
"estetiko."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"Specifically, we aim to combine a wide range of behavioural methodologies to"
" characterize the ways in which people from diverse backgrounds internalize "
"and process external conditions, both in the auditory (e.g., speech, music) "
"and visual (e.g., faces, color) domains."
msgstr ""
"Natančneje, naš cilj je združiti širok spekter vedenjskih metodologij, da bi"
" opisali načine, na katere ljudje iz različnih okolij ponotranjijo in "
"obdelajo zunanje pogoje tako na slušnem (npr. govor, glasba) kot na vidnem "
"(npr. obrazi, barve) področju."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study the role of experience and exposure "
"in creating and affecting our perception, decisions and actions."
msgstr ""
"Namen tega projekta je preučiti vlogo izkušenj in izpostavljenosti pri "
"ustvarjanju in vplivanju na naše zaznavanje, odločitve in dejanja."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We are also interested in the way that these internal representations affect"
" human decision making and behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Zanima nas tudi, kako te notranje predstave vplivajo na človekovo odločanje "
"in vedenje."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will not be indexed by personal information but will "
"be linked to personal information by a key (such as “afasd12314asdasd”)."
msgstr ""
"Avdio-vizualno gradivo ne bo indeksirano po osebnih podatkih, temveč bo z "
"osebnimi podatki povezano s ključem (na primer \"afasd12314asdasd\")."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"During data collection, audio-visual material will be recorded on a separate"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Med zbiranjem podatkov se bo avdiovizualno gradivo snemalo na ločenem "
"strežniku."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Personal information will be stored separately from audio-visual materials "
"and encrypted using a strong encryption protocol (such as Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."
msgstr ""
"Osebni podatki bodo shranjeni ločeno od avdiovizualnega gradiva in šifrirani"
" z uporabo močnega protokola šifriranja (kot je Advanced Encryption "
"Standard)."

